.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# Guard against ~/.gitignore_global's `_*` pattern silently untracking
# __init__.py forever (found live, Sprint 7e: app/providers/__init__.py was
# never committed, in any branch, ever — every provider-backed endpoint
# (/route, /ground, /synthesise, /propose-tags, /segment-facts, /ocr-page)
# ImportErrors on a truly fresh `git clone` + Docker build, because Python
# then treats `app.providers` as a namespace package with no re-exports).
!**/__init__.py
